{"version":1,"content":"<p>微軟文檔指出，並不建議用户僅因電腦裝有32GB內存就關閉頁面文件。Windows頁面文件（pagefile.sys）不僅用於在需要時把較少訪問的已修改數據移出內存，也會擴大系統能夠向應用程式承諾的內存總量，並為系統崩潰轉儲提供存儲空間。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583574.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:04:42.737426+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T11:37:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T12:58:11.861481+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T12:58:11.861481+00:00","content_hash":"0d230480c31b4f917efc60e3dd129ae0b5dc8fc63d32c7a06b5f1b1924e61e2c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}